    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi AABBO Waaqi keesani worra isaani lafa isani iraa fud'attani balleese, ka isani dirafi mana worraa ira fud'attani keesa teetani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lafa suni fulla saditi gargari baasa ka kamu dira ufi qabu. Duuba nami nama ijeesu dandae dira suni tokoti baqata, aka lubbu ufii baasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.2+DEU.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.2",
              "DEU.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo nami nama nyaapa isaa intahini, danu ijeese, inni dandae dira kana tokoti baqate lubbu ufii baasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fakeenna, yo nami lama woliini badda seene mukha mure ato nami toko mukha muru d'agaraani isaa sukka keesaa bahe, nama wahela isaa kaani ijeese, inni dandae dira suni sadeeni tokoti baaqate lubbu ufii baasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo diri suni toko ch'alla taate, takachi suni nama ira fagaata duuba fiit'aani nama ijeesani suni ka haalo baasufi, nama kaani ka woma keesa injirre hegeri d'aqabe ijeesa. Ka ufuftu nami sunini namuma nyaapa isaa intahini danu ijeese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi anini Dira sadi huji tana koba baasa isaniini jed'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja Waaqi keesani, akuma inni ababoota teesaniti kakhate, lafa teesani ballise, lafa inni isanii kakhate ch'ufa isanii keenne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dira kana saadeeniti dira d'ibi saadi dara. (Yo isani waan anini arra isaniini jed'e ch'ufa guutani AABBO Waaqa keesani jaalattani kara isaa gula yaatani inni lafa tana isanii kenna.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan kana tolcha, aka nami woma keesa injirre indoone, isanileeni lafa AABBO Waaqi isanii kennu keesati worra suni ijeeftani wollaala inarganne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
